Subject: [PATCH] wbemdisp: the scripting object model (properties, methods,
 qualifiers, paths, privileges)

SWbemProperty: Name, IsLocal, Origin, CIMType, IsArray, Qualifiers_ and a typed
Value put. SWbemPropertySet: _NewEnum, Add, Remove. SWbemMethod: Name, Origin,
OutParameters, Qualifiers_; SWbemMethodSet: _NewEnum, Count. SWbemObject: calling a
method as obj.Method(args) with the arguments in parameter ID order and ByRef
out parameters, Put_, Delete_, Instances_, Subclasses_, Associators_, References_,
Clone_, SpawnInstance_, SpawnDerivedClass_, CompareTo_, Qualifiers_, Derivation_,
Path_, Security_, GetTypeInfo. SWbemServices: Delete, SubclassesOf, AssociatorsOf,
ReferencesTo, ExecNotificationQuery (SWbemEventSource). New classes:
SWbemQualifierSet/SWbemQualifier, SWbemObjectPath, SWbemPrivilegeSet/SWbemPrivilege,
SWbemEventSource. SWbemSecurity keeps its levels (locator and connection) and the
locator's authentication level is unset until put, as the tests record; NamedValue
Value/Name, NamedValueSet _NewEnum/Count/Clone, enumerator Clone, LockServer.
Removes the todo_wine marks that now pass.

